    "title": "Traba",
    "description": "Traba helps find you work at the best open shifts that fit your schedule. Se habla espa\u00f1ol!\r\n\r\nEasily browse available shifts, accept the best matches, and manage your schedule all in the app. Work the shifts you want, when you want. Traba helps you gain experience in a variety of work environments and roles, with skills development opportunities available.\r\n\r\nTraba helps you get hired in the following roles:\r\n\r\nWarehouse Associate\r\n\r\nPicker/Packer\r\n\r\nFood Production Associate\r\n\r\nEvents Operations\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media to hear about the latest opportunities available!\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/TrabaPros\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/traba.work/\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/traba-work\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/traba_work\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.traba.work/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.traba.work/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nQuestions? Reach out to us at support@traba.work.",
